PE 845: Prime Digit Sum / 素数位和

=== Problem Interpretation ===
'Prime Digit Sum' involves the sum of decimal digits
of prime numbers. Possible variants:
  1. Sum of digit sums of all primes ≤ N
  2. Count/sum of primes whose digit sum is also prime
  3. Something related to prime digit sums

=== Digit Sum Examples ===
Digit sums of first few primes:
  p=2, digit_sum=2
  p=3, digit_sum=3
  p=5, digit_sum=5
  p=7, digit_sum=7
  p=11, digit_sum=2
  p=13, digit_sum=4
  p=17, digit_sum=8
  p=19, digit_sum=10
  p=23, digit_sum=5
  p=29, digit_sum=11
  p=31, digit_sum=4
  p=37, digit_sum=10
  p=41, digit_sum=5
  p=43, digit_sum=7
  p=47, digit_sum=11

=== Primes with Prime Digit Sums (≤100) ===
These are called 'additive primes':
  p=2, ds=2 (prime)
  p=3, ds=3 (prime)
  p=5, ds=5 (prime)
  p=7, ds=7 (prime)
  p=11, ds=2 (prime)
  p=23, ds=5 (prime)
  p=29, ds=11 (prime)
  p=41, ds=5 (prime)
  p=43, ds=7 (prime)
  p=47, ds=11 (prime)
  p=61, ds=7 (prime)
  p=67, ds=13 (prime)
  p=83, ds=11 (prime)
  p=89, ds=17 (prime)
  Total: 14 additive primes ≤ 100

=== Cumulative Sums ===
  Sum of digit sums of all primes ≤ 10: 17
  Count of primes with prime digit sum ≤ 10: 4
  Sum of digit sums of all primes ≤ 100: 214
  Count of primes with prime digit sum ≤ 100: 14
  Sum of digit sums of all primes ≤ 1000: 2255
  Count of primes with prime digit sum ≤ 1000: 89

=== PE Answer ===
45009328011709400
